            (key: "aasimar/emberkin", name: "Aasimar (Emberkin)", summary: "Resist acid, cold and electricity 5 and +2 vs blinding and dazzling; +2 Lore (Religion) and Knowledge (Arcana); Burning Arc once a day.", guide: "character-creation#aasimar-emberkin", ability_modifiers: [Fixed(ability: Intelligence, amount: 2), Fixed(ability: Charisma, amount: 2)]),
